From 4a8a5b71fb07bab0560db43e95d82bd4d7dd1d6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Evan Boldt <evan.d.boldt@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:46:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/xe: debugfs for Battlemage pcode overclocking domains

Replays the Windows KMD (32.0.101.9033) IGCL overclock sequence:
capability enumeration (0x5f/0, 0x5f/1, 0x5e/0-4), stage/commit
writes (0x5e/6 retried on busy, 0x5e/8 polled), the power-limit
setter's domain choice and proportional rescaling, and the OC exit
(0x5f/4, 0x5f/3). Exposed under dri/N/oc/{domains,power_limit,write,exit}.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
